# ============================================================
# Step 3 of 3 - Figure 2 main panels (R2 + remaining)
# In Vivo Combinatorial Cas12a CRISPR Screen
# Breast Cancer Lung Metastasis (Day 3 vs. Day 18)
# ============================================================
# Driver: scripts/make_figure_2.R
# Depends on output/tables/ produced by Steps 1 and 2.
#
# MAIN-FIGURE PANELS generated by THIS script (final A-I lettering):
#   Fig2C  - Sample PCA across all conditions            (Fig2C_PCA)
#   Fig2D  - Rank plot of all R1 crRNA pairs             (Fig2D_rank_plot)
#   Fig2G  - R2 volcano (2nd-round 17x17 pair frequency) (Fig2G_volcano)
#   Fig2H  - R2 GI Z-score heatmap                       (Fig2H_GI_heatmap)
#   Fig2I  - Strong-edge GI network of the R2 genes      (Fig2I_GI_network)
#
# SUPPLEMENTARY panel generated by THIS script (written to _supplementary/):
#   SuppFig2Q - Functional-module epistasis pattern      (SuppFig2Q_module_epistasis)
#
# MAIN-FIGURE PANELS from other scripts:
#   Fig2E  - Guide-level LFC distribution  (scripts/01_prepare_r1_gi_tables.R)
#   Fig2A/B/F - external (Illustrator schematic; microscopy; GI-score cartoon)
#
# The spectral embedding and the within-vs-cross forest plot were MOVED OUT of
# the main figure in the A-I revision; they are now SuppFig2J and SuppFig2K and
# are still produced by scripts/02_r1_modules.R.
#
# RETIRED / NOT SHOWN (exploratory variants, not part of any figure; code kept
# only as a legacy snapshot in archive/scripts_supplementary/): Fig2Ma, Fig2N/Na
# (this script), the module pathway-leaning dotplot and 3x3 module-pair heatmap
# (02_r1_modules.R), the STRING PPI network (20_*), and the PPI-vs-GI overlap
# (30_*). The STRING/PPI comparison was not pursued. Supplementary Figure 2 is the
# Cas12a-system validation + screen-QC figure (scripts/make_supp_figure_2.R).
#
# DATA DEPENDENCIES:
#   data/raw/R1_construct_counts.csv   — R1 per-construct counts, 20 samples
#   data/derived/R2_Day18.gene_summary.txt — MAGeCK gene summary, 2nd round
#   output/tables/R2_GI_derived.csv        — GI values, built by 04_r2_derive_gi.R
#   output/tables/all_gene_pairs_full.csv  — 1st-round aggregated gene-pair stats
#   output/tables/GI_scores_all_dualKO.csv — 1st-round dual-KO GI scores + FDR
#   output/tables/module_assignments.csv   — spectral clustering module membership
#
# USAGE:
#   Rscript scripts/03_main_panels.R
#   (or source() / run interactively in RStudio)
#
# All figures are saved to: output/figures/
# ============================================================


# ============================================================
# SECTION 0: Setup
# ============================================================

